<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="cs">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8"/>
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0"/>
<title>Investiční plán klienta – renta, majetek, pronájem a hypotéka</title>
<style>
:root{
  --bg:#eef3fb;
  --card:#ffffffcc;
  --text:#101828;
  --muted:#61708a;
  --line:#d9e2f1;
  --blue:#2563eb;
  --blue2:#eaf2ff;
  --green:#16a34a;
  --green2:#eaf8ee;
  --purple:#7c3aed;
  --orange:#f59e0b;
  --red:#ef4444;
  --shadow:0 18px 50px rgba(35,53,84,.12);
  --radius:24px;
}
*{box-sizing:border-box}
body{
  margin:0;
  font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,"SF Pro Display","Segoe UI",Roboto,Arial,sans-serif;
  color:var(--text);
  background:
    radial-gradient(circle at 10% 0%,rgba(37,99,235,.13),transparent 34%),
    radial-gradient(circle at 92% 10%,rgba(22,163,74,.10),transparent 30%),
    linear-gradient(180deg,#fbfdff 0%,var(--bg) 100%);
}
.app{max-width:1780px;margin:0 auto;padding:22px}
.topbar{
  display:grid;
  grid-template-columns:260px 1fr 260px;
  gap:20px;
  align-items:center;
  margin-bottom:18px;
}
.brand{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;font-weight:900;font-size:19px}
.mark{
  width:40px;height:22px;border-radius:999px;border:5px solid #5b8cff;
  transform:skewX(-20deg);
  background:rgba(255,255,255,.65);
}
.tabs{display:flex;justify-content:center;gap:18px}
.tab{
  padding:12px 20px;border-radius:18px;
  color:#24334b;font-weight:650;font-size:14px;
}
.tab.active{background:#e7f0ff;color:#1556d8}
.profile{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:flex-end;gap:12px}
.avatar{width:42px;height:42px;border-radius:50%;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#e5edfb,#fff);border:1px solid var(--line)}
.profile strong{display:block;font-size:15px}
.profile span{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}

.layout{
  display:grid;
  grid-template-columns:410px minmax(760px,1fr) 420px;
  gap:18px;
  align-items:start;
}
.card{
  background:var(--card);
  border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.95);
  border-radius:var(--radius);
  box-shadow:var(--shadow);
  backdrop-filter:blur(22px);
}
.section{padding:24px}
h2{font-size:23px;margin:0 0 8px;letter-spacing:-.035em}
h3{font-size:18px;margin:0 0 14px;letter-spacing:-.02em}
.desc{color:var(--muted);font-size:15px;margin:0 0 22px;line-height:1.45}
.formgrid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:12px}
.field{margin-bottom:13px}
label{display:block;font-size:13px;font-weight:800;color:#172033;margin-bottom:7px}
input,select{
  width:100%;
  border:1px solid var(--line);
  border-radius:15px;
  background:#fff;
  min-height:48px;
  padding:11px 14px;
  font-size:15px;
  color:#101828;
  outline:none;
}
input:focus,select:focus{border-color:#8bb5ff;box-shadow:0 0 0 4px rgba(37,99,235,.09)}
.suffix{position:relative}
.suffix small{position:absolute;right:14px;top:39px;color:#667085;font-size:13px}
.suffix input{padding-right:44px}
.infoBox{
  background:#edf5ff;
  border:1px solid #cfe2ff;
  color:#1d3d6d;
  border-radius:18px;
  padding:15px 16px;
  font-size:14px;
  line-height:1.45;
  margin-top:14px;
}
button{
  width:100%;
  border:none;
  min-height:52px;
  border-radius:17px;
  color:#fff;
  background:linear-gradient(135deg,#2563eb,#5b8cff);
  font-size:15px;
  font-weight:850;
  cursor:pointer;
  box-shadow:0 14px 30px rgba(37,99,235,.22);
}
.mainTop{padding:24px}
.clientSummary{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.4fr .8fr .8fr .8fr;gap:12px;margin:12px 0 18px}
.clientPill{background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:18px;padding:14px 16px}
.clientPill small{display:block;color:#667085;font-size:12px;font-weight:800;margin-bottom:5px}
.clientPill strong{display:block;font-size:18px;letter-spacing:-.02em}
.cards2{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:18px}
.variant{
  border-radius:22px;
  padding:24px;
  border:1px solid;
  background:#fff;
}
.variant.green{border-color:#b9e7c6}
.variant.blue{border-color:#b8d1ff}
.variant .label{font-size:14px;font-weight:950;text-transform:uppercase;line-height:1.2;letter-spacing:.02em}
.variant.green .label{color:#159a35}
.variant.blue .label{color:#2468ff}
.variant .big{font-size:38px;line-height:1;font-weight:950;letter-spacing:-.055em;margin:18px 0 14px}
.variant.green .big{color:#159a35}
.variant.blue .big{color:#2468ff}
.variant p{margin:0 0 16px;color:#44546b;font-size:14px}
.tag{
  display:flex;
  justify-content:center;
  border-radius:12px;
  padding:11px;
  font-weight:850;
  font-size:14px;
}
.green .tag{background:var(--green2);color:#159a35}
.blue .tag{background:var(--blue2);color:#2468ff}

.chartCard{margin-top:18px;padding:24px}
.chartHead{display:flex;align-items:flex-start;justify-content:space-between;gap:20px;margin-bottom:12px}
.legend{display:flex;gap:18px;font-size:13px;color:#43546d}
.legend span{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px}
.dot{width:26px;height:3px;border-radius:999px;background:#111}
.dot.g{background:#21a33a}.dot.b{background:#2468ff}
canvas{width:100%;height:330px}
.bottomGrid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr 1fr;gap:18px;margin-top:18px}
.resultBox{
  padding:22px;
  border-radius:22px;
  background:#fff;
  border:1px solid var(--line);
}
.resultBox h3{font-size:17px}
.resultBox .value{font-size:26px;font-weight:950;letter-spacing:-.04em;margin:10px 0 4px}
.resultBox.green .value{color:#159a35}
.resultBox.blue .value{color:#2468ff}
.resultBox.purple .value{color:#7c3aed}
.resultBox p{margin:0;color:#667085;font-size:13px;line-height:1.4}

.side .section{padding:24px}
.compareItem{
  display:flex;
  gap:14px;
  align-items:center;
  padding:15px;
  border-radius:18px;
  border:1px solid var(--line);
  background:#fff;
  margin-bottom:10px;
}
.icon{
  width:42px;height:42px;border-radius:50%;
  display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;
  font-weight:950;
}
.i-green{background:#eaf8ee;color:#16a34a}
.i-purple{background:#f2ebff;color:#7c3aed}
.i-orange{background:#fff4db;color:#f59e0b}
.i-blue{background:#eaf2ff;color:#2563eb}
.i-red{background:#ffedf0;color:#ef4444}
.compareItem small{display:block;color:#667085;font-size:13px}
.compareItem strong{display:block;font-size:18px;letter-spacing:-.02em;margin-top:2px}
.recommend{
  margin-top:10px;
  background:#eaf2ff;
  border:1px solid #bdd6ff;
  border-radius:18px;
  padding:18px;
  color:#24334b;
  line-height:1.45;
  font-size:14px;
}
.scenarioCard{margin-top:16px}
.table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:13px}
.table th,.table td{padding:11px 7px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);text-align:right}
.table th:first-child,.table td:first-child{text-align:left}
.table th{color:#667085;font-size:12px}
.linkButton{
  display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;
  min-height:48px;border-radius:15px;
  background:#fff;color:#1556d8;
  border:1px solid #bdd6ff;
  font-weight:850;text-decoration:none;
  box-shadow:0 10px 22px rgba(37,99,235,.08);
}
.linkButton:hover{background:#eaf2ff}
.assetMini{
  border-radius:18px;background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--line);
  padding:14px 15px;margin:8px 0 13px;
  color:#24334b;font-size:14px;line-height:1.45;
}
.assetMini strong{font-size:18px;letter-spacing:-.02em}

.mortgageLayout,.riskLayout{display:grid;grid-template-columns:420px minmax(760px,1fr) 420px;gap:18px;align-items:start}
.mortgageCards{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr 1fr;gap:18px;margin-top:18px}
.mortgageHero{padding:24px}
.mortgageNote{background:#fff7ed;border:1px solid #fed7aa;color:#7c2d12;border-radius:18px;padding:16px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.45;margin-top:14px}
.dot.r{background:#ef4444}.dot.inv{background:#16a34a}.dot.payoff{background:#2563eb}

.reportWrap{display:grid;grid-template-columns:360px 1fr;gap:18px;align-items:start}
.reportControls .check{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;margin:10px 0;font-weight:800;color:#172033}
.reportControls input[type=checkbox]{width:18px;height:18px;min-height:18px}
.reportDoc{background:#fff;border-radius:28px;padding:28px;border:1px solid var(--line);box-shadow:var(--shadow)}
.reportHero{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.3fr .7fr;gap:18px;align-items:stretch;margin-bottom:18px}
.reportTitle{padding:24px;border-radius:24px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#eef5ff,#ffffff);border:1px solid #d9e8ff}
.reportTitle h1{margin:0 0 8px;font-size:34px;letter-spacing:-.055em}
.reportTitle p{margin:0;color:#61708a;line-height:1.45}
.reportBadge{padding:24px;border-radius:24px;background:#101828;color:#fff}
.reportBadge small{display:block;color:#cbd5e1;font-size:13px;margin-bottom:8px}
.reportBadge strong{display:block;font-size:26px;letter-spacing:-.04em}
.reportSection{margin-top:18px;padding:24px;border-radius:24px;border:1px solid var(--line);background:#fbfdff;break-inside:avoid}
.reportSection h2{margin-bottom:12px}
.reportKpis{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:12px;margin-top:12px}
.reportKpi{border:1px solid var(--line);background:#fff;border-radius:20px;padding:16px}
.reportKpi small{display:block;color:#667085;font-weight:800;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:8px}
.reportKpi strong{display:block;font-size:22px;letter-spacing:-.04em}
.reportKpi.green strong{color:#16a34a}.reportKpi.red strong{color:#ef4444}.reportKpi.blue strong{color:#2563eb}.reportKpi.purple strong{color:#7c3aed}
.reportText{color:#44546b;font-size:15px;line-height:1.5;margin:12px 0 0}
.reportChart{width:100%;height:230px;margin-top:8px;background:#fff;border-radius:20px;border:1px solid var(--line)}
.reportChart{max-width:520px;width:48%;height:210px;display:inline-block;vertical-align:top}
.reportSection>.reportText{display:inline-block;width:48%;margin-left:2%;vertical-align:top;margin-top:8px;padding:16px;border-radius:18px;background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--line)}
.reportSection>.reportKpis,.reportSection>.reportSplit{clear:both}
.reportRiskBreakdown{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:12px;margin-top:12px;clear:both}
@media(max-width:1250px){.reportChart,.reportSection>.reportText{width:100%;max-width:none;margin-left:0;display:block}.reportRiskBreakdown{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}}
.reportSplit{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:14px;margin-top:12px}
.reportNote{margin-top:18px;color:#667085;font-size:12px;line-height:1.45}
.printBtn{margin-top:16px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#101828,#344054);box-shadow:none}

.clearTools{margin-top:14px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:10px}
.clearBtn{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#f97316,#fb923c);box-shadow:none;min-height:46px}
.clearBtn.danger{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#ef4444,#f87171)}
.clearNote{font-size:13px;color:#61708a;line-height:1.35;margin-top:10px}
@media(max-width:1250px){.reportWrap,.reportHero,.reportSplit{grid-template-columns:1fr}.reportKpis{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}}
@media print{body{background:#fff}.topbar,.reportControls{display:none!important}.app{padding:0;max-width:none}.reportWrap{display:block}.card{box-shadow:none;border:none}.reportDoc{box-shadow:none;border:none;border-radius:0}.hidden{display:none!important}.reportKpis{grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr)}.reportSection{break-inside:avoid}}

@media(max-width:1250px){.mortgageLayout,.riskLayout{grid-template-columns:1fr}.mortgageCards{grid-template-columns:1fr}}

.hidden{display:none}

.reportWrap{display:grid;grid-template-columns:360px 1fr;gap:18px;align-items:start}
.reportControls .check{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;margin:10px 0;font-weight:800;color:#172033}
.reportControls input[type=checkbox]{width:18px;height:18px;min-height:18px}
.reportDoc{background:#fff;border-radius:28px;padding:28px;border:1px solid var(--line);box-shadow:var(--shadow)}
.reportHero{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.3fr .7fr;gap:18px;align-items:stretch;margin-bottom:18px}
.reportTitle{padding:24px;border-radius:24px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#eef5ff,#ffffff);border:1px solid #d9e8ff}
.reportTitle h1{margin:0 0 8px;font-size:34px;letter-spacing:-.055em}
.reportTitle p{margin:0;color:#61708a;line-height:1.45}
.reportBadge{padding:24px;border-radius:24px;background:#101828;color:#fff}
.reportBadge small{display:block;color:#cbd5e1;font-size:13px;margin-bottom:8px}
.reportBadge strong{display:block;font-size:26px;letter-spacing:-.04em}
.reportSection{margin-top:18px;padding:24px;border-radius:24px;border:1px solid var(--line);background:#fbfdff;break-inside:avoid}
.reportSection h2{margin-bottom:12px}
.reportKpis{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:12px;margin-top:12px}
.reportKpi{border:1px solid var(--line);background:#fff;border-radius:20px;padding:16px}
.reportKpi small{display:block;color:#667085;font-weight:800;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:8px}
.reportKpi strong{display:block;font-size:22px;letter-spacing:-.04em}
.reportKpi.green strong{color:#16a34a}.reportKpi.red strong{color:#ef4444}.reportKpi.blue strong{color:#2563eb}.reportKpi.purple strong{color:#7c3aed}
.reportText{color:#44546b;font-size:15px;line-height:1.5;margin:12px 0 0}
.reportChart{width:100%;height:230px;margin-top:8px;background:#fff;border-radius:20px;border:1px solid var(--line)}
.reportChart{max-width:520px;width:48%;height:210px;display:inline-block;vertical-align:top}
.reportSection>.reportText{display:inline-block;width:48%;margin-left:2%;vertical-align:top;margin-top:8px;padding:16px;border-radius:18px;background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--line)}
.reportSection>.reportKpis,.reportSection>.reportSplit{clear:both}
.reportRiskBreakdown{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:12px;margin-top:12px;clear:both}
@media(max-width:1250px){.reportChart,.reportSection>.reportText{width:100%;max-width:none;margin-left:0;display:block}.reportRiskBreakdown{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}}
.reportSplit{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:14px;margin-top:12px}
.reportNote{margin-top:18px;color:#667085;font-size:12px;line-height:1.45}
.printBtn{margin-top:16px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#101828,#344054);box-shadow:none}
@media(max-width:1250px){.reportWrap,.reportHero,.reportSplit{grid-template-columns:1fr}.reportKpis{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}}
@media print{body{background:#fff}.topbar,.reportControls{display:none!important}.app{padding:0;max-width:none}.reportWrap{display:block}.card{box-shadow:none;border:none}.reportDoc{box-shadow:none;border:none;border-radius:0}.hidden{display:none!important}.reportKpis{grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr)}.reportSection{break-inside:avoid}}

@media(max-width:1250px){
  .clientSummary{grid-template-columns:1fr}
  .topbar{grid-template-columns:1fr}
  .tabs{justify-content:flex-start;overflow:auto}
  .profile{justify-content:flex-start}
  .layout{grid-template-columns:1fr}
  .bottomGrid{grid-template-columns:1fr}
}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="app">
  <div class="topbar">
    <div class="brand"><div class="mark"></div><span>Investiční plán klienta</span></div>
    <nav class="tabs">
      <div class="tab active" onclick="switchTab('invest')">Investice</div>
      <div class="tab" onclick="switchTab('risk')">Pojištění</div>
      <div class="tab" onclick="switchTab('mortgage')">Hypotéka</div>
      <div class="tab" onclick="switchTab('report')">Report</div>
    </nav>
    <div class="profile"><div class="avatar"></div><div><strong>Filip Solár</strong><span>Poradce</span></div></div>
  </div>

  <section id="investPage">
    <div class="layout">
      <aside class="card">
        <div class="section">
          <h2>Vstupní údaje</h2>
          <p class="desc">Základní informace o klientovi a jeho investičním cíli.</p>

          <div class="field">
            <label>Jméno klienta</label>
            <input id="clientName" value="Novák Martin">
          </div>

          <div class="formgrid">
            <div class="field suffix"><label>Věk dnes</label><input id="age" type="number" value="35"><small>let</small></div>
            <div class="field suffix"><label>Renta od věku</label><input id="rentAge" type="number" value="45"><small>let</small></div>
          </div>

          <div class="field suffix"><label>Renta 1 měsíčně</label><input id="rent1" type="text" inputmode="numeric" value="180000"><small>Kč</small></div>
          <div class="formgrid">
            <div class="field suffix"><label>Renta 1 do věku</label><input id="rent1Until" type="number" value="75"><small>let</small></div>
            <div class="field suffix"><label>Renta 2 od věku</label><input id="rent2From" type="number" value="75"><small>let</small></div>
          </div>
          <div class="field suffix"><label>Renta 2 měsíčně</label><input id="rent2" type="text" inputmode="numeric" value="150000"><small>Kč</small></div>

          <div class="formgrid">
            <div class="field suffix"><label>Renta má vydržet do věku</label><input id="endAge" type="number" value="90"><small>let</small></div>
            <div class="field suffix"><label>Zhodnocení p.a.</label><input id="pre" type="number" step="0.1" value="8"><small>%</small></div>
          </div>
          <div class="formgrid">
            <div class="field suffix"><label>Zhodnocení v rentě</label><input id="post" type="number" step="0.1" value="7"><small>%</small></div>
            <div class="field suffix"><label>Odkaz dětem</label><input id="legacy" type="text" inputmode="numeric" value="0"><small>Kč</small></div>
          </div>

          <div class="field suffix"><label>Majetek určený k budoucímu prodeji (exit)</label><input id="current" type="text" inputmode="numeric" value="150000"><small>Kč</small></div>
          <div class="field suffix"><label>Zhodnocení majetku do exitu</label><select id="currentYield"><option value="2">2 % p.a.</option><option value="3">3 % p.a.</option><option value="4" selected>4 % p.a.</option><option value="5">5 % p.a.</option></select></div>
          <div class="field suffix"><label>Příjem z pronájmu v rentě</label><input id="rentalIncome" type="text" inputmode="numeric" value="0"><small>Kč</small></div>
          <div class="assetMini">
            <small>Budoucí hodnota majetku při exitu</small><br>
            <strong id="assetInlineValue">—</strong>
          </div>
          <div class="field suffix"><label>Jednorázová investice dnes</label><input id="lump" type="text" inputmode="numeric" value="3000000"><small>Kč</small></div>

          <button onclick="calculate()">Přepočítat plán</button>

          <div class="infoBox">
            Majetek se zhodnocuje samostatně tempem 2–5 % p.a. a do rentového plánu se započítá při startu renty jako budoucí exit.<br><br>
            Příjem z pronájmu v rentě snižuje potřebnou měsíční rentu, kterou musí vytvořit investiční kapitál.
          </div>

          <div class="infoBox">
            <strong>Státní důchod</strong><br>
            Státní důchod zde nepočítáme. Klient si jej může orientačně ověřit přes IDA ČSSZ.
            <br><br>
            <a class="linkButton" href="https://www.cssz.gov.cz/informativni-duchodova-aplikace-ida-" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Otevřít IDA ČSSZ</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </aside>

      <main>
        <div class="card mainTop">
          <h2>Investiční plán klienta</h2>
          <p class="desc">Výpočet cílového kapitálu, potřebné měsíční investice, budoucí hodnoty majetku a kapitálové mezery.</p>
          <div class="clientSummary">
            <div class="clientPill"><small>Klient</small><strong id="summaryClient">—</strong></div>
            <div class="clientPill"><small>Věk dnes</small><strong id="summaryAge">—</strong></div>
            <div class="clientPill"><small>Start renty</small><strong id="summaryRentAge">—</strong></div>
            <div class="clientPill"><small>Majetek při exitu</small><strong id="summaryExitAsset">—</strong></div>
          </div>
          <div class="cards2">
            <div class="variant green">
              <div class="label">Varianta 1<br>Čerpat pouze výnosy</div>
              <div class="big" id="capitalInterest">—</div>
              <p>Měsíční renta z výnosů: <strong id="rentInfo1">—</strong></p>
              <div class="tag">Kapitál zůstává zachován</div>
            </div>
            <div class="variant blue">
              <div class="label">Varianta 2<br>Čerpat výnosy i jistinu</div>
              <div class="big" id="capitalDeplete">—</div>
              <p>Měsíční renta během čerpání: <strong id="rentInfo2">—</strong></p>
              <div class="tag">Kapitál se postupně snižuje</div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="card chartCard">
          <div class="chartHead">
            <div>
              <h2>Vývoj kapitálu v čase</h2>
              <p class="desc" style="margin-bottom:0">Graf zobrazuje stabilní rentu bez automatického navyšování.</p>
            </div>
